## Tutorials

❮ Math Methods

Thecos()method returns the cosine of an angle.

Note:Angles are measured in radians.

Tip:You can use the constantMath.PIto make fractions of PI for angles.

### Code Examples

```
Example
Return the cosine of different angles:
System.out.println(Math.cos(3));
System.out.println(Math.cos(-3));
System.out.println(Math.cos(0));
System.out.println(Math.cos(Math.PI));
System.out.println(Math.cos(Math.PI/2));
Try it Yourself »
```

